              "mk-6cFebjis@1179"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch02.s03.p05.r06",
            "text": "When decoding, an extra space usually appears before punctuation after joining, so that space has to be removed.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "mk-6cFebjis@1168",
              "mk-6cFebjis@1171",
