              "mk-6cFebjis@1208"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch02.s03.p06.r03",
            "text": "After that, the instance can call the \"encode\" and \"decode\" methods.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "mk-6cFebjis@1211",
              "mk-6cFebjis@1213"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ch02.s03.p06.r04",
